  "description": "Zeno White, the spoiled heir of the nouveau riche White family, enters cryogenic sleep on the day of the apocalypse.\nTwo hundred years later, he awakens after a massive earthquake—only to find the world in complete ruin.\nThe only thing left is a sex-droid programmed to obey him.\n\nThus begins the solitary life of Zeno White and Noah, just the two of them in a desolate world.\nBut in a world where they are the last ones standing, how will their cohabitation end?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/white_jenoa)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/white_jenoa), [Lezhin](https://lezhin.jp/comic/white_jenoa)  \nOthers: [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/white_genoa), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/white_jenoa)",
